徽章 + 绿色条纹文字「NOTRE DAME」，右紫色袖子白色印花文字「TEXAS UNIVER」，袋鼠口袋为淡紫色；下装纯白色阔腿工装束脚长裤，侧边工装大口袋，白色中筒袜，银灰色厚底增高老爹鞋\n女性角色（后方站立配角）\n浅金色齐耳短发少女，无帽子，蓝眼睛，细黑色 choker 颈圈，站在男生身后半身露出；穿搭参考潮玩撞色街头套装：内搭蓝色豹纹高领打底，外穿宽松 oversize 黄橙奶牛斑点连帽外套，外套胸口粉色兔子卡通小 logo，搭配同豹纹长袜，高饱和度拼色厚底撞色老爹鞋，甜酷千禧 Y2K 街头风格\n环境道具（保留原图全套生活化电商道具）\n画面左下角敞开棕色快递纸箱，箱内塞满手机壳、彩妆小数码配件；画面右下角绿色收纳工具箱，箱上摆放紫盖白色洗护瓶、带吸管分层冰咖啡、精油护发瓶，地面斜放浅色智能手机"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 6, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"disabled": false}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [415.6598815917969, 517.3235473632812], "pos": [7506.5703125, -328.7831726074219], "id": 7, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.26.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}, {"name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "size": [437.2978515625, 725.5224609375], "pos": [8958.1669921875, -331.19805908203125], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 11, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}], "flags": {"disabled": false}, "id": 10, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.26.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"filename_prefix": true}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 17}, {"outputs": [{"name": "width", "links": [2], "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "